{"parentUuid":"579a74a4-413c-48d5-bf3e-94aedb5c13a2","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"a7253f978e1829a88","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Wne86KdZxqkWFD8LVbn9xM","type":"tool_result","content":"   ARCH.REQ.platform-matrix | Supported-target matrix (OS × ISA × GPU API × store × support tier) | engine-architect | E |platform-architect,build-system-toolchains,ci-cd-automation,certification-compliance \n   ARCH.ORG.bootstrap | Walking-skeleton definition & bring-up order | program-orchestration | E |engine-architect,platform-architect,ci-cd-automation \n   ARCH.ORG.triage | Failure attribution, bisection, routing to owners, revert-first policy | program-orchestration | E |ci-cd-automation,perf-benchmarking \n   ARCH.PROD.customer-corpus | Customer/reference project corpus validating each release | engine-product-management | E |api-lifecycle-migration,functional-automation-soak \n   CORE.JOBS.introspection | Task tracing, critical-path & utilization analysis, OS scheduler correlation | job-system-task-graph | E |observability-telemetry \n   CORE.FRAME.headless | Headless / server tick model | frame-orchestration | E |dedicated-server \n   CNT.COOK.world-build | World-scoped derived-data build graph: region invalidation, distributed bakes, staleness reporting | content-pipeline-architect | E |world-architect,ci-cd-automation \n   CNT.COOK.shared-cache | Team/cloud derived-data cache deployment & health | content-pipeline-architect | E |ci-cd-automation |[[\"team-large\"]]\n   CNT.COOK.gpu-steps | GPU & training cook steps with pinned-artifact determinism & dataset lineage | content-pipeline-architect | M |ml-inference-runtime,ci-cd-automation \n   CNT.VAL.submit-gate | Validate-on-save & pre-submit content checks (domain validators registered via hooks) | content-pipeline-architect | E |ci-cd-automation \n   RND.RHI.software-device | Null/software GPU device for headless CI (WARP/lavapipe/SwiftShader class) | rhi-core | E |render-validation \n   RND.SHADER.cache | Shader caches & distributed compilation | shader-system | E |ci-cd-automation \n   INP.DEV.injection | Virtual input device injection for bots & tests | input-devices-haptics | E |functional-automation-soak \n   NET.ARCH.validation | Netcode oracle suite: deterministic net simulation, prediction/replication correctness metrics | network-architect | E |functional-automation-soak \n   NET.SRV.headless | Headless server build & stripping | dedicated-server | E  \n   ED.ARCH.headless | Headless editor & commandlets | editor-architect | E |ci-cd-automation \n   ED.ARCH.agent-api | Agent/automation control & introspection protocol for editor and runtime | editor-architect | M |visual-debugging-tools,observability-telemetry \n   ED.COLLAB.binaries | Large binary storage strategy | collaboration-version-control | E |ci-cd-automation \n # ED.DEBUG Visual debugging {}\n   ED.DEBUG.draw | Debug draw API | visual-debugging-tools | E  \n   ED.DEBUG.console | In-game console & cheat commands | visual-debugging-tools | E  \n   ED.DEBUG.inspector | Runtime entity inspector & gameplay debugger | visual-debugging-tools | E  \n   ED.DEBUG.visual-log | Visual logger & rewind | visual-debugging-tools | E |determinism-replay \n   ED.DEBUG.menus | Debug menus & overlays | visual-debugging-tools | E |observability-telemetry \n   ED.DEBUG.imgui | Immediate-mode developer UI (in-game, with remote front end for servers) | visual-debugging-tools | E |editor-ui-framework \n # BLD.CI CI/CD & automation {}\n   BLD.CI.pipelines | CI pipelines | ci-cd-automation | E  \n   BLD.CI.farm | Build farm & artifact storage | ci-cd-automation | E | |[[\"team-large\"]]\n   BLD.CI.gating | Pre-submit & merge gating | ci-cd-automation | E |test-architect \n   BLD.CI.symbols | Symbol server & symbol management | ci-cd-automation | E |crash-diagnostics \n   BLD.CI.devices | Device-farm orchestration | ci-cd-automation | E |functional-automation-soak |[[\"team-large\"]]\n   BLD.CI.cli | Developer CLI & automation | ci-cd-automation | E  \n   BLD.CI.orchestration | Code → content → package pipeline orchestration | ci-cd-automation | E  \n   BLD.CI.binary-distribution | Prebuilt editor/tool binaries matched to content revisions | ci-cd-automation | E |collaboration-version-control \n   BLD.CI.build-distribution | Build distribution to QA, playtesters, betas & devkits | ci-cd-automation | E |platform-console,packaging-release-patching \n   BLD.CI.local-first | Zero-infrastructure local workflow (local caches, single-machine CI) | ci-cd-automation | E |collaboration-version-control \n   QA.STRAT.flaky | Flaky-test management | test-architect | E |ci-cd-automation \n   QA.STRAT.integration | Cross-skill integration suites & per-configuration build/boot/test matrix | test-architect | E |ci-cd-automation,developer-experience-docs \n # QA.FUNC Functional & stability testing {}\n   QA.FUNC.automation | Gameplay automation & bots | functional-automation-soak | E  \n   QA.FUNC.smoke | Smoke & boot tests | functional-automation-soak | E  \n   QA.FUNC.soak | Soak & stability testing (memory growth, leaks) | functional-automation-soak | E  \n   QA.FUNC.compat | Hardware / OS compatibility matrix | functional-automation-soak | E  \n   QA.FUNC.network | Network test harnesses | functional-automation-soak | E |network-transport \n   QA.FUNC.load | Server load testing | functional-automation-soak | E |dedicated-server \n   QA.FUNC.editor | Editor & tool automation, regression & soak testing | functional-automation-soak | E |editor-ui-framework \n   QA.FUNC.agent-exploration | RL/LLM exploratory test agents | functional-automation-soak | M  \n   QA.FUNC.bug-capture | In-game bug reporting with repro capture & tracker integration | functional-automation-soak | E |crash-diagnostics,observability-telemetry,determinism-replay \n   QA.FUNC.playtest | Playtest capture, heatmaps & UX-research instrumentation | functional-automation-soak | E |observability-telemetry \n   QA.AGENT.test-integrity | Detection of weakened tests (deleted/skipped cases, loosened tolerances, assert-free tests, input special-casing) as a merge gate | test-architect | E |ci-cd-automation \n   PRF.METH.gates | Performance gates in CI | performance-architect | E |ci-cd-automation \n   PRF.BENCH.regression | Regression detection & bisection | perf-benchmarking | E |ci-cd-automation \n   PRF.BENCH.scale-content | Procedural synthetic stress worlds per configuration & scale dimension | perf-benchmarking | E |procedural-generation,functional-automation-soak,reference-games \n   PRF.LOAD.hitch-gate | Load & hitch trace analyzers and the hitch gate | loading-streaming-performance | E |ci-cd-automation \n   OBS.CRASH.symbolication | Symbolication | crash-diagnostics | E |ci-cd-automation \n   OBS.CRASH.feedback | In-game bug/feedback capture boundary for players | crash-diagnostics | E |functional-automation-soak \n   XC.DET.conformance | Determinism conformance matrix (toolchain × ISA × platform × cores × schedule) as CI gate | determinism-replay | E |ci-cd-automation,test-architect,robustness-fuzzing \n   XC.SEC.secrets | Secrets management | security-engineering | E |ci-cd-automation \n   XC.SEC.agent-boundary | Development-agent capability scoping, sandboxing, egress & prompt-injection threat model | security-engineering | E |program-orchestration,ci-cd-automation \n   XC.SEC.testing | Pen testing, red-teaming, secret scanning & shipping-build hardening audit | security-engineering | E |robustness-fuzzing,ci-cd-automation,visual-debugging-tools","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e7ebe14c-1be6-4eab-835f-5ee982436fe4","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:24:17.966Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"579a74a4-413c-48d5-bf3e-94aedb5c13a2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
